Rune @VERSION@. Ctrl-D ends the session.
- :type [1, 2]
[1, 2] : int list
- :doc Option.isSome
val isSome : 'a option -> bool
  Option : OPTION, docs/generated/basis/sig/OPTION.md#val-issome

isSome opt is true when opt carries a value.

Example isSome (SOME 0) = true
- fun f 0 = raise Fail "zero" | f n = f (n - 1);
val f = fn : int -> 'a
- f 2 : int;
uncaught exception Fail: zero
  raised in f at stdIn#1:1:17 (:bt for the rest)
- :bt
  in f at stdIn#1:1:17
  in <toplevel> at stdIn#2:1:1
-
